Package: candebugger
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: ZLG USBCANFD-200U CAN/CANFD debugger (Qt Quick UI)
 A Qt5 Quick/QML based bus debugger for ZLG USBCANFD-200U adapters.
 .
 Features:
  - channel configuration (bit timing, sample point, termination, listen-only,
    merge-receive) with live device info (SN / hardware / firmware / API version)
  - real-time receive with software display filtering and hardware acceptance
    filtering, timestamped frame list (relative / absolute)
  - single-frame and software-timed periodic transmit over CAN and CAN FD, with
    data generators (CRC-8, rolling counter, incremental fill, ID increment)
  - per-channel statistics (frame rate, bus load, error count, Top-N by ID)
  - zero-dependency live plotting of bus load and frame rates
  - background-thread recording (ASC / CSV) and replay with speed control
 .
 This package is self-contained: it ships its own Qt5 runtime libraries, Qt
 platform plugins and the QtQuick/QML modules under /opt/candebugger, plus the
 proprietary libusbcanfd.so. It installs a udev rule granting regular users
 access to the 3068:0009 USB device.
